#
# One path per line, repo-relative; blank lines and `#` comments ignored (the
# same grammar as .skills/doc-sensitive-paths). Read by
# scripts/context_manifest_drift.py, which reports every tracked Markdown file
# at the repo root or under docs/ that no declared artifact covers.
#
# Entries are checked, not trusted: an exemption naming a file that is gone, or
# one that has since been declared, is reported as stale. An opt-out nobody
# revisits is a blindfold.

